There are affordable upgrade deals from 5000/120, 5000/125, 5000/133 and 
5000/240 to 3000/400. Also from 5000/240 to 3000/500. The price is
about $99 per specmark for each specmark difference between the
two systems. There are no commercial discounts and only a 7% 
educational discount. You only need to return the CPU box.

There are no such affordable upgrade deals for 2100/3100 or 5000/200.
We have asked DEC several times about a decent upgrade path for
5000/200's, but no, that would be too logical! The only upgrade
available right now is to a 3000/400 with 19" Color monitor.
You need to return the complete system (eventhough it may already
have the same type of 19" color monitor on it). The price due to
discounting problems, turns out to be more than if we bought a 
new system from scratch.

