While PKZIP is freeware, the Zip and UnZip programs from the Info-ZIP
group *are* freeware.  Zip and UnZip are compatible with the PKZIP
format.

You can get the latest versions for VMS via anonymous ftp from
ftp.spc.edu in [.MACRO32.SAVESETS] as UNZIP50P1.ZIP and ZIP19P1.ZIP.
UNZIP.EXE is in [.MACRO32].

You can also get the via e-mail by sending the following commands in
the body of a mail message to FILESERV@WKUVX1.BITNET:

SEND ZIP19P1
SEND UNZIP50P1
SEND FILESERV_TOOLS

Include the command DIR ALL for a brief listing of all the packages
available from my FILESERV.

