You can't use XDM unmodified on Ultrix/ENHANCED or Ultrix/UPGRADE because
verify.c/Verify() calls getpwnam() and crypt() instead of getauthuid()
and crypt16()  and the passwd data and crypt calls are different under this
regime.

Admittedly the mods are trivial. 

