The green light indicating data in the buffer after a time-out should be
on.  This is because the LN03 needs a Formfeed char to finish any page.

So, send it a <FF> (^L) and it'll print OK.  DEC MS-DOS distributes a little 
program called FF.COM that trivially does that, etc.

