	to MLS+, Digital's B1/Compartmented Mode solution.
	The meeting provides a forum for MLS+ users and developers
	to share experiences and expectations. Those who want to
	share their own MLS+ experiences are encouraged to submit   
	technical papers and present at the meeting.

	In addition to papers, abstracts for panel discussions will 
	also be	considered. Please include proposed panelists 
	including a chair. 

	There will be an award for the best paper or panel session.

	*** The registration fee of $15.00 will be waived for all 
	speakers and panelists.*** 

