	- Discussion of practical experience with MLS+

	- How MLS+ helped meet customer requirements 

	- Programming for the MLS+ environment

	- Porting applications to MLS+

	- MLS+ technology components, e.g. trusted networking, 
	  auditing,user interface,access control,and identification 
	  and authentication

	- Database systems on MLS+ 

	- Multi-level networking in the real world

	- Usability issues (user interface design and information 
	  delivery)

	- MLS+ and C2 
	
