		pub/davy/nfswatch4.0.tar.Z

	gatekeeper.dec.com (16.1.0.2):
		pub/net/ip/nfs/nfswatch4.0.tar.Z

It will undoubtedly be available from numerous other archive sites in
a matter of time; check Archie for details.  Please do not contact the
authors regarding other methods of distribution (e.g., e-mail); we do
